media/raw-*.mp4

# Markdown is internal by default. With only the media rule above, CLAUDE.md
# deployed as a static asset and answered 200 under a robots.txt that invites
# every crawler (record-audit.py in suede-seo, 2026-09-11). This project deploys
# through the Git integration, which honours .vercelignore: suedeai-org closed
# the same leak the same way and its CLAUDE.md now 404s. The accomplishments
# record is the one markdown file meant to be public.
*.md
!docs/accomplishments.md

# Never a page: agent and session config, CI workflows, tests, build scripts,
# database schemas. All of these answered 200 on 2026-09-11 (record-audit.py in
# suede-seo). This project runs no build command, so excluding scripts/ and
# tests/ from the upload changes nothing about what gets built.
.claude/
.codex/
.github/
tests/
test/
scripts/
supabase/
*.sql
*.py
